# Client (`@adv/client`)

- Services: `create*Service` in `apps/client/src/services/`; wire via `game-session.ts`
- State: `@adv/core` Store + `ui/useStore.ts` — no Redux/Zustand
- Preact hooks from `preact/hooks`; DOM `class="..."` (not React `className`)
- Hub categories only: `archiv` · `hero` · `story` · `missions` · `workshop` · `collection` · `social`
- Tooltips: `ui/Tip.tsx` + DE/EN keys; keep `tip-i18n.test.ts` green
- Extend existing CSS tokens (`styles/variables.css`, `hub.css`, `game-shell.css`)
- Formulas belong in `@adv/sim`, not TSX

Skills: `safe-ui-patch` (tiny), `.agents/skills/client-feature` / `ui-hub` / `i18n-content` (larger).
